  "releaseNotes": "- Config: Renames Player to Playback and moves decoder settings into the Video, Audio, Subtitles and Data sections\n\t\t- Config: Moves stream enablement, delays, subtitle parsing, statistics and renderer adjustments to their runtime owners\n\t\t- Config.Video: Renames VideoAcceleration to HWAcceleration and removes the unused SwsForce option\n\t\t- Player: Introduces LastRecordingFilename for the most recently finalized recording\n\t\t- Player: Introduces SnapshotCompleted to report snapshot results and errors\n\t\t- Player: Introduces SeekStarted and extends SeekCompleted to seeks during playback\n\t\t- Player: Supports forcing subtitle inputs in OpenAsync and selecting a preferred video decoder per open\n\t\t- FlyleafHost: Fixes DPI-dependent panorama drag sensitivity, improves inertia cancellation and lets derived hosts opt out of player swapping\n\t\t- Renderer.Panorama: Fixes filtering across the longitude seam and uses the fitted viewport for projection\n\t\t- Renderer: Adds original-size display and fixes one-pixel gaps when fitting near-matching aspect ratios [Fixes #729]\n\t\t- Renderer: Exposes the active video processor and its filters\n\t\t- Renderer: Exposes SDR/HDR black and peak levels for the luminance panel\n\t\t- Renderer: Exposes source crop bounds for the crop controls\n\t\t- Renderer: Prevents pending update flags from being lost during concurrent requests\n\t\t- SwapChain: Skips zero-size resize requests and refreshes when restored to the same size\n\t\t- OpenDefault: Routes HLS manifests named .m3u to the demuxer and preserves playlist entry user agents\n\t\t- MediaExtensions: Consolidates media extension lists and expands image discovery\n\t\t- Logger: Preserves the current destination if a new log file cannot be opened\n\t\t- Logger: Prevents pending log rotation from affecting a replacement file\n\n\t\tBreaking changes: Public APIs and configuration format\n\t\tConsumers must update their API calls, rebuild and recreate settings from earlier versions",
